flowchart TD
 I[Initialize thread state] --> C[Compile-validated entry node]
 C --> N[Execute node with current state]
 N --> U[Validate partial state update]
 U --> R[Apply deterministic reducer]
 R --> E{Conditional or normal edge?}
 E -->|Route key| Q[Resolve compiled route map]
 E -->|Static edge| S[Select next node]
 Q --> S
 S --> P[Persist state + next node + version]
 P --> X{Terminal, interrupt or continue?}
 X -->|Continue| N
 X -->|Interrupt| H[Wait for authenticated decision]
 H --> L[Resume same thread from checkpoint]
 L --> N
 X -->|Terminal| O[Return final state and trace]
